{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","commonName":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","title":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","order":52,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"9d308c8d86a14221fd0e7fbb3c2dc0c9b0bb9f135f232c215f0c0ba08cffe4b6","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TH/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":89},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["最后我们无法再忍受思念之苦，就决定我们留在雅典，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["派提摩太去你们那里。他在传扬基督福音的事工上是我们的弟兄、上帝的同工。他去是要鼓励你们，使你们信心坚定，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["免得有人因遭受这些患难而动摇，因为你们知道我们必遭受患难。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们在你们那里时曾预先告诉过你们，我们会遭遇患难，你们知道后来果然如此。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因此，我无法再等下去了，就派提摩太到你们那里看看你们的信心如何，免得那诱惑人的诱惑了你们，使我们的心血都白费了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["喜闻佳讯"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["现在，提摩太刚从你们那里回来，把有关你们信心和爱心的好消息告诉了我们。他说你们常常思念我们，很想见到我们，就像我们渴望见到你们一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["弟兄姊妹，你们的信心使我们在万般困苦和患难中得到了激励。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["得知你们靠着主坚定不移，我们现在无比振奋。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你们使我们在上帝面前感到非常喜乐，我们该怎样为你们感谢上帝呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我们昼夜恳切祷告，渴望能见到你们，弥补你们信心的不足之处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["愿我们的父上帝和主耶稣引领我们到你们那里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["愿主使你们彼此之间的爱和对他人的爱一齐增长，甚至满溢出来，就像我们爱你们一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["这样，愿我们的主耶稣带着祂的众圣徒再来时，使你们心里刚强，在我们的父上帝面前完全圣洁，无可指责。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TH/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}